---
title: Bent-Over High Cable Flyes
type: docs
prev: docs/grud/
---
![сведение рук в кроссовере сверху стоя в наклоне](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee60c839-3564-4e85-afb5-bd9ba89dd33d)

{{% steps %}}

### Step 1
Grab the handles attached to the high pulleys on both sides and stand in the center of the cable crossover machine.

### Step 2
Bring your hands together in front of you and hinge forward at the hips until your torso is nearly parallel to the floor. Keep a slight, soft bend in your elbows.

### Step 3
Inhale and slowly open your arms out to the sides until your elbows are in line with your shoulders.

### Step 4
Exhale and bring your hands all the way back together in front of you, squeezing your chest muscles firmly.


{{% /steps %}}

{{< callout type="info" >}}
• Keep your torso completely still throughout the movement—avoid swinging your upper body.

• Keep your back straight, chest open, and shoulder blades pulled back to ensure a full stretch and strong muscle contraction.

• Focus on sweeping with your chest rather than pressing with your triceps; keep the bend in your elbows fixed.
{{< /callout >}}
